WEBVTT

00:10:57.528 --> 00:11:01.490
to ask questions and support each other.

00:11:01.532 --> 00:11:04.076
They are creating a community

00:11:04.076 --> 00:11:06.787
and an environment that is safe

00:11:06.829 --> 00:11:07.996
and their own.

00:11:08.914 --> 00:11:10.082
In middle school,

00:11:10.124 --> 00:11:13.419
the students are starting
to become socially aware.

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:19.675
They care about things like world hunger,
immigration and homelessness.

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:22.845
One year,

00:11:22.886 --> 00:11:26.306
the seventh-graders
at TAF at Saghalie in Federal Way

00:11:26.348 --> 00:11:31.770
turned their classrooms
into an immigration museum